<title>USA: Trans World Gaming names president/CEO.</title>
<headline>Trans World Gaming names president/CEO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trans World Gaming Corp said Tuesday it named Andrew Tottenham president and chief executive.</p>
<p>The appointment follows the merger of Trans World with Tottenham &amp; Co, a private gaming consulting group in London. Tottenham is president of the gaming consulting firm with the same name.</p>
<p>He succeeds Stanley Kohlenberg, who remains chairman of Trans World.</p>
<p>Tottenham &amp; Co is operated as a wholly owned subsidiary of Trans World.</p>
